flowchart TD
    Start([Invoice Expiration Service Started]) --> Schedule[Schedule Periodic Checks<br/>Every 5 minutes]
    Schedule --> Timer{Timer Triggers}

    Timer --> |Check Time| Lock{Acquire Check Lock}
    Lock --> |Already Running| Skip[Skip - Check in Progress]
    Lock --> |Lock Acquired| Query[Query Database<br/>SELECT * FROM payments<br/>WHERE state = 'PENDING'<br/>AND expires_at < NOW]

    Query --> Results{Expired<br/>Payments?}
    Results --> |No Payments| Release1[Release Lock]
    Results --> |Found Payments| Process[Process Each Payment]

    Process --> ForEach[For Each Expired Payment]
    ForEach --> Transition[Call State Machine<br/>transition to EXPIRED]

    Transition --> TransitionSuccess{Transition<br/>Successful?}
    TransitionSuccess --> |Yes| SendEmail[Send Email Notification<br/>Invoice Expired Template]
    TransitionSuccess --> |No| LogError1[Log Error<br/>Increment Failed Count]

    SendEmail --> EmailSuccess{Email<br/>Sent?}
    EmailSuccess --> |Yes| IncrementSuccess[Increment Success Count<br/>Log Success]
    EmailSuccess --> |No| LogError2[Log Error<br/>Increment Failed Count]

    IncrementSuccess --> NextPayment{More<br/>Payments?}
    LogError1 --> NextPayment
    LogError2 --> NextPayment

    NextPayment --> |Yes| ForEach
    NextPayment --> |No| UpdateMetrics[Update Service Metrics<br/>- Total Checks<br/>- Total Expired<br/>- Total Failed<br/>- Last Check Time<br/>- Duration]

    UpdateMetrics --> Release2[Release Lock]
    Release1 --> End([Check Complete])
    Release2 --> End
    Skip --> End

    End --> Timer

    style Start fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style End fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style Query fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style Transition fill:#8b5cf6,stroke:#7c3aed,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style SendEmail fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style LogError1 fill:#ef4444,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style LogError2 fill:#ef4444,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style UpdateMetrics fill:#06b6d4,stroke:#0891b2,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
